[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14641.11, "timestamp": "04:04:01", "text": "还有驴。还有沙子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14645.429, "timestamp": "04:04:05", "text": "这里曾经还有一座沙堡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14647.359, "timestamp": "04:04:07", "text": "沙堡。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14663.429, "timestamp": "04:04:23", "text": "哦，乔恩。你还记得那段时光吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14665.51, "timestamp": "04:04:25", "text": "我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14673.67, "timestamp": "04:04:33", "text": "然后，我们进入了创作模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14684.95, "timestamp": "04:04:44", "text": "是的，我们只是在探索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14693.189, "timestamp": "04:04:53", "text": "我可以瞬间移动到你身边吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14695.269, "timestamp": "04:04:55", "text": "是啊，是啊，是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14697.03, "timestamp": "04:04:57", "text": "等等，不，你不需要那个。我是"}]